(a) Whenever any vehicle, under this article is animal-drawn, the fitness of the animal for the work and its humane treatment, shall be under the inspectors for the City of Cartersville, appointed, by the city, who shall have power to determine:
(1) Physical fitness of the animal and limitation on work and conditions of work;
(2) Condition and fitness of harness;
